  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Safety (Phases 4\u20135)",
      "items": [
        "User messages are redacted in the API before the agent runs; PIIMiddleware redacts tool results and replies, and the SSE stream is redacted too",
        "web_search pauses for approval when the query has sensitive terms or an order number",
        "New messages to a paused thread get 409"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Memory (Phases 3 and 6)",
      "items": [
        "Short-term: each thread's checkpoints; older turns are summarized past CONTEXT_MAX_TOKENS (10k)",
        "Long-term pushes: the summarized turns at the token breach, a thread idle for 30 min, the Remember this button, or the remember tool",
        "MemoryWriter asks gpt-5-mini for the user's facts and decides add / update / delete against the 5 closest memories",
        "Placeholders and claims of status or discounts are never stored; temporary facts expire through the store's TTL",
        "One push per user at a time across processes (Postgres advisory lock); every turn recalls the closest memories"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Reliability",
      "items": [
        "ModelCallLimitMiddleware ends a run after MAX_MODEL_CALLS",
        "Both search tools retry once, then give the model an error to relay",
        "A failed memory write is logged and doesn't affect the reply; one failed fact doesn't lose the others"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Optional",
      "items": [
        "Langfuse tracing when LANGFUSE keys are set",
        "MEMORY_ENABLED, PII_ENABLED, HITL_ENABLED and WEB_SEARCH_ENABLED switch features off",
        "Empty RERANKER_MODEL disables reranking"
      ]
    }
  ]
